{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268JrVw4NOFf1793274896.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關與警方聯手採取打擊偷運私煙行動，檢獲逾2千萬支懷疑私煙。</p><p></p><p>海關與警方水警總區本月13至27日展開聯合行動，偵破共9宗偷運私煙案件，合共拘捕7名男子，檢獲逾2千萬支懷疑私煙，扣查5艘大馬力快艇及4輛車，估計檢獲物品總市值達9,500萬元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CUSTOMS-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bBV1y3uxOg1793274722.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>調查人員相信，走私集團會在凌晨或深夜，利用快艇將未完稅香煙偷運入境，在偏遠岸邊卸貨，再用貨車運走。由於部分私煙品牌在香港並不常見，海關相信私煙集團，會進行「二次走私」，即轉運至海外市場。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:15.539833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.149953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:26.122543+00:00","content_hash":"591fb698e17856c2d3cad04f8233212826eb426680ea71577628d4ea88156e99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:15.539833+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}